# ---------------- SelfTest_Dummy.events (Task 51 Part C) ----------------
# The `Dummy` actor in SelfTest.scene: a target for `me sees` / `me stops seeing` and for the
# `send message` routing case. It lives in its own file so the dummy never registers a copy of
# the runner's cases — every `when` block with an `expect` is a case, and this sheet has none.

when me appears
  set PingCount to 0

when message "ping" arrives
  add 1 to PingCount
